</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/d18578fc-eaf0-11f1-9279-f9cf020caef6/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-11-27T110013Z-410933699-RC2K8OA5ONF8-RTRMADP-3-USA-PENTAGON-AIR-FORCE-CLOUD.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/d18578fc-eaf0-11f1-9279-f9cf020caef6/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-11-27T110013Z-410933699-RC2K8OA5ONF8-RTRMADP-3-USA-PENTAGON-AIR-FORCE-CLOUD.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">33866d7c-eaf1-11f1-ab33-b7f3664ca006</guid><pubDate>Sat, 28 Nov 2026 06:04:56 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/d18578fc-eaf0-11f1-9279-f9cf020caef6/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-11-27T110013Z-410933699-RC2K8OA5ONF8-RTRMADP-3-USA-PENTAGON-AIR-FORCE-CLOUD.jpg">© Dado Ruvic, Reuters</source><dc:creator>FRANCE 24</dc:creator></item><item><category>France</category><title><![CDATA[S&P revises France's outlook from 'stable' to 'negative']]></title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/france/20261127-s-p-revises-france-s-outlook-from-stable-to-negative</link><description><![CDATA[
